# Tower origin (no trailing slash). AVIF export POSTs a PNG to /api/v1/images/optimize; also used for auth/OAuth.
# Local `vite` dev: leave VITE_TOWER_ORIGIN unset so the bundle uses localhost Tower (same port as Tower `PORT` / 3100); setting it to production would send OAuth/API traffic to prod.
# Default: http://<TOWER_DEV_HOST>:<port> where port is TOWER_PORT (Beacon), else Tower apps/tower/.env `PORT`, else 3100.
# Production Webflow bundles default Tower to https://tower.codalyn.app (app host — not codalyn.app marketing). Override with `.env.production` if needed.
# Preview bundles (`build:preview`) default to https://tower-preview.codalyn.app. Override with `.env.preview` if needed.
# Override for staging/prod or non-default hosts:
# VITE_TOWER_ORIGIN=https://tower.example.com
# TOWER_DEV_HOST=localhost
# TOWER_PORT=3100

# Optional: match Tower `BEACON_API_KEY` for /api/v1 calls without a Tower session (e.g. AVIF). Prefer signing in via Webflow in the extension (session bearer).
# Client-visible in the bundle — dev/local only unless you accept exposing a site token.
VITE_BEACON_API_KEY=

# Release stage shown in Settings version footer. Unset = early access. Set `stable` or `ga` after public launch.
# VITE_BEACON_RELEASE_STAGE=early-access

# CMS Slots (Designer / Composer). Production: set to exactly "true" to enable. Dev disables only when set to "false".
# VITE_CMS_SLOTS_SURFACE_ENABLED=true

# --- Observability (optional overrides — shared Codalyn defaults apply when unset) ---
# PostHog — filter by super properties app + environment (production | development | preview)
# VITE_POSTHOG_KEY=
# VITE_POSTHOG_HOST=
# Set to 0, false, or off to disable telemetry locally.
# Note: Sentry is deliberately absent from the extension bundle (Webflow Marketplace: its
# transport creates a sandbox iframe). PostHog carries error reporting via capture_exceptions.

# Chromatic (Storybook publish) — project token from chromatic.com project settings. Read by the chromatic CLI (dotenv); not VITE_-prefixed so never bundled.
# CHROMATIC_PROJECT_TOKEN=
